    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a 3D transformation: position, rotation, and scale. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This struct is used as a component in the ECS system to store the spatial properties of an entity.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Rotation is stored as Euler angles (pitch, yaw, roll) in radians. Usually only the roll is used in 2D games. </para>
</simplesect>
